# One Good Deed? (windurst 92): the Peerifool death's Prog operand. Accepted by GM at Prog 0, a level-75 WAR in Bibiki
# Bay, under Perfect Dodge by GM (effect 49). The qm_deed spawns the six; Prog 1 and NMKilled 5 by GM: PEERIFOOL
# killed, no count (NMKilled stays 5); Prog 0 by GM: the qm_deed: nil (the cutscene needs 6). One kill only: a later
# kill with no rezone can reach onMobDeath with no player credited, skipping the quest's handler (TODO row: "Golden
# kill leaves the char engaged on the dead mob").
lists BibikiBay/qm_deed/onTrigger BibikiBay/onEventFinish/34
char zone=BibikiBay pos=-319.7,-2.74,-735.3 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Windurst.OneGoodDeed accepted
login
effect 49                                     # a GM: Perfect Dodge (every melee hit evaded)
trigger qm_deed                               # Prog 0, NMKilled 0, none up: the six spawn
charvar Quest[2][92]Prog 1
localvar NMKilled 5
kill PEERIFOOL                                # Prog 1: no count (NMKilled stays 5)
charvar Quest[2][92]Prog 0
trigger qm_deed                               # Prog 0, NMKilled 5: nil (NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY)
